# decorations (2026-11-08): a house sits on an edge-middle cell of its tile block, a hotel on all four, a mortgaged tile's block floods (pond), each player has a token in a block corner. Stand-in tiles picked by eye from the atlas.
TILEMAP | house      | 16
TILEMAP | hotel      | 14
TILEMAP | mort       | 3
